message: "If you use this software in your work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "femur-strength-regressor"
abstract: >-
  Config-driven machine-learning pipeline that predicts femur strength
  from CT images of the femur combined with clinical and load-case features.
  The methods were developed in 2024; this repository is a refactored, documented
  release of that work.
